## About the standard

NIST control baselines for SP 800-53; the moderate baseline is reproduced here as an OSCAL catalogue.

The control and requirement statements below are reproduced in English from the publisher’s open data.

Official source: [NIST SP 800-53B](https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/sp/800/53/b/upd1/final).

